  "analysis_plan": "Primary (two robots, 20 seeds, 18 conditions, seed averages over equally weighted conditions, 95% t intervals). (1) Front: for each allowance rule f in {staff_phi, omitted_phi} x phi in {3, 10}, the selection value S_f = R(cov_f) - J_f, where R(cov) is the random admission curve of the condition, linear in coverage between the random arms that bracket cov_f (arms at the coverage of staff rollout, omitted support and the four allowance rules; per seed J, per condition mean coverage); and the difference S_staff(phi) - S_omit(phi). (2) Equal coverage: J(omitted_quota) - J(staff_rollout), with omitted_quota calibrated to the coverage of staff rollout, and the path B = [J(omit) - J(quota)] + [J(quota) - J(staff)]. (3) Coverage adjustment per condition: slope between the random arms at the coverage of staff rollout and of omitted support in each condition. Secondary, exploratory: subsets by arrangement, unavailability and delay; mission composition of omitted_quota and the random arms.",
